# What `gcloud run deploy --source .` may upload to Cloud Build: everything git would track
# (.gitignore already keeps out .env, every PDF, local runs and the index), minus what the
# image doesn't need. Never upload: .env (secrets) and docs/**/*.pdf (the owner's copyrighted book).
#!include:.gitignore
#!include:.dockerignore
.git
.gitignore
experiments/results/rl/2026110*
!experiments/results/rl/20261108-185428/
eval/results/
